# 15. Important Warnings

## Do not use setup_server=false on a brand-new EC2

If the EC2 is brand new and you run:

```text
setup_server: false
```

then the workflow may upload files, but the website may not work because Nginx may not be installed/configured.

For a new EC2, use:

```text
setup_server: true
```

---

## Do not terminate unless you really want to delete

Stopping is safe.

```text
Stop = pause server, keep data
Terminate = delete server
```

For your project, use stop, not terminate.

---

## DuckDNS only needs updating when Elastic IP changes

Normally, Elastic IP does not change.

So after the first setup:

```text
No need to update DuckDNS every time
```

Update DuckDNS only if:

```text
Elastic IP was deleted
A new Elastic IP was created
DuckDNS points to the wrong IP
```

